Policies: User.Id MemberId,
    Concat(User.FirstName, < >, User.LastName) Member,
    Plan.Name Plan,
    Status PolicyStatus,
    Coalesce(MemberClaims.Claims, <0>) Claims,
    ROUND(Coalesce(MemberPremiums.PremiumsCollected, <0>), <2>) PremiumsCollected,
    ROUND(Coalesce(MemberClaims.AllowedAmount, <0>), <2>) AllowedAmount,
    ROUND(Coalesce(MemberClaims.InsurerPaid, <0>), <2>) InsurerPaid,
    ROUND(<100.0> * Coalesce(MemberClaims.InsurerPaid, <0>) / NULLIF(MemberPremiums.PremiumsCollected, <0>), <2>) MemberLossRatioPercent
  Order MemberLossRatioPercent DESC, Claims DESC
  Take 10
  Left Join MemberPremiums MemberPremiums On UserId = MemberPremiums.UserId
  Left Join MemberClaims MemberClaims On UserId = MemberClaims.UserId
MemberPremiums is PremiumPayments: Policy.UserId UserId, SUM(Amount) PremiumsCollected
  Where Status = <Paid>
MemberClaims is Claims: Policy.UserId UserId, COUNT(Id) Claims, SUM(AllowedAmount) AllowedAmount, SUM(PaidAmount) InsurerPaid
